pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: |
  讲解建议：三项优先级不并列铺开，而是共享一个原则——先改善单位经济模型，再谈规模增长。
elements:
  - elementId: page-marker
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [872, 36, 28, 28]
    shapeName: ellipse
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primary" }

  - elementId: page-number
    elementType: text
    bounds: [872, 36, 28, 28]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 11
      bold: true
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      align: [center, middle]
      text: "05"

  - elementId: eyebrow
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 38, 500, 24]
    content:
      style: "$eyebrow"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 05 · 2026 战略重点

  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 66, 840, 46]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 聚焦续约、订阅与效率，不扩规模摊子

  - elementId: subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 116, 840, 26]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 三项优先战役共享一个原则：先改善单位经济模型，再谈规模增长。

  - elementId: header-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 152, 840, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: priority-rule-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 286, 400, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: priority-rule-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 416, 400, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: priority-1-number
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 170, 70, 80]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 38
      bold: true
      color: "$accent"
      align: [left, top]
      text: "01"

  - elementId: priority-1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 174, 310, 34]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 19
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 客户成功优先

  - elementId: priority-1-detail
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 214, 310, 56]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 13
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: 华东区续约率 78% → 88%，重点客户覆盖率 42% → 100%。

  - elementId: priority-2-number
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 300, 70, 80]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 38
      bold: true
      color: "$accent"
      align: [left, top]
      text: "02"

  - elementId: priority-2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 304, 310, 34]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 19
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 订阅产品优先

  - elementId: priority-2-detail
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 344, 310, 56]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 13
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: SaaS ARR 增长 35%，订阅收入占比 58% → 65%。

  - elementId: priority-3-number
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 430, 70, 80]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 38
      bold: true
      color: "$accent"
      align: [left, top]
      text: "03"

  - elementId: priority-3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 434, 310, 34]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 19
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 效率优先

  - elementId: priority-3-detail
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 474, 310, 52]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 13
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: 单客户 CAC 下降 20%，人均确认收入提升 15%。

  - elementId: roadmap-heading
    elementType: text
    bounds: [480, 164, 420, 28]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 16
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 2026 关键战役路线图

  - elementId: roadmap-table
    elementType: table
    bounds: [480, 194, 420, 300]
    columnWidths: [0.24, 0.19, 0.19, 0.19, 0.19]
    rowHeights: [0.22, 0.26, 0.26, 0.26]
    style:
      cellStyle:
        fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
        fontSize: 11
        color: "$text"
        fill: { type: solid, color: "#F7F3E8" }
        border: [null, null, { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line" }, null]
        align: ["center", "middle"]
      firstRowStyle:
        fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
        fontSize: 12
        fill: { type: solid, color: "$primary" }
        color: "#FFFFFF"
        bold: true
      bodyStyles:
        - { fill: { type: solid, color: "$primarySoft" } }
        - { fill: { type: solid, color: "#F7F3E8" } }
      rowOverColumn: true
    rows:
      - - text: 关键战役
        - text: Q1
        - text: Q2
        - text: Q3
        - text: Q4
      - - text: 客户成功
          bold: true
        - text: 团队 3→8 到位
        - text: 续约率 82%
        - text: 续约率 85%
        - text: 续约率 88%
      - - text: 订阅增长
          bold: true
        - text: 新定价上线
        - text: V4.0 发布
        - text: ARR +20%
        - text: ARR +35%
      - - text: 效率提升
          bold: true
        - text: 渠道结构审计
        - text: CAC ≤1.6万
        - text: 人效 +10%
        - text: 人效 +15%

  - elementId: footnote
    elementType: text
    bounds: [480, 500, 420, 22]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: 路线图目标为建议值，可按董事会意见调整。
